{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced action gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo or local co-op up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character and weapon upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 50 different enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 levels in 4 different worlds</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cyber Siege - Kepler-186 Under Attack!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's the year 2347, and the four planets in the Kepler-186 system face a huge danger: the Voidborn. This hostile alien alliance wants to drain the planets' life force. The only hope against them are  advanced defense robots, called mechs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World 1: Veridia - Gray Planet:</strong> The Voidborn first appear in Veridia's underground. They take over a huge maze of tunnels filled with a strange, pale blue light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465820/extras/335eae76564860e592285cd071a06350.avif?t=1771490599\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World 2: Crystalia - Green Planet:</strong> The fight on the green Crystalia gets much scarier. Deep inside its caves live giant, glowing spiders \u2013 some real, some advanced robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465820/extras/8807276c715da2de58cdf919696554fd.avif?t=1771490599\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World 3: Xylos - Cold Planet:</strong> Xylos, is a cold planet with a blue sky and vast snow plains. The Voidborn are establishing bases across its wide, icy landscapes, stretching to the horizon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465820/extras/4a9caa5f32c0f163ee7314a2b245ced0.avif?t=1771490599\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World 4: Technos - Red Planet:</strong> The final battle takes place on Technos, inside the Voidborn's main base \u2013 the Core Nexus. This place is a strong, high-tech area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465820/extras/934ab50bbe927cb706330cd8685aec5a.avif?t=1771490599\" width=1560 height=878 /></span> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3465820?t=1771490599","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465820/0c127aecda1ce18b9b118d9470471baf029a236d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771490599","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465820/ff25a390891363577591f4d95c8240c9997889d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771490599","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465820/ff25a390891363577591f4d95c8240c9997889d8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771490599","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"descri